{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"tool_calls","index":0,"message":{"content":"Looking at the evidence I have, I can see the 2022 World Championship data on cuetracker.net. The question asks about a match \"before 2022\" - but the 2022 World Championship was played in April-May 2022. Let me re-examine the matches I found to see if any match the break patterns described.\n\nLooking at the data I have, let me check the matches against the criteria:\n\n**Winner's breaks:** one 50s, two 60s, two 70s, more than one 100s\n**Loser's breaks:** more than two but less than five 50+ breaks, including one 50s, more than one 70s, one 90s\n\nLet me check the Trump-Bingham quarter-final (e2):\n- Trump (winner): 50s=3, 60s=0, 70s=3, 80s=1, 90s=0, 100s=1 → doesn't match (needs two 60s, two 70s, more than one 100)\n- Bingham (loser): 50s=5, 60s=0, 70s=0, 80s=1, 90s=0, 100s=1 → doesn't match\n\nLet me check the O'Sullivan-Maguire quarter-final (e2):\n- O'Sullivan (winner): 50s=2, 60s=2, 70s=3, 80s=0, 90s=1, 100s=2 → doesn't match (needs one 50s, two 70s)\n\nLet me look more carefully at the 2022 World Championship data and also search for the 2021 World Championship, since \"before 2022\" could mean the 2021 championship.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"cuetracker.net world championship 2021 selby murphy breaks\", \"2021 world snooker championship final selby 18 murphy 15 frame scores breaks\", \"cuetracker 2021 world championship selby quarter final breaks table\"], \"top_k\": 10}","name":"search"},"id":"call_fc3634d7f16b4032a6ac1f51","index":0,"type":"function"}]}}],"created":1789482796,"id":"chatcmpl-bd156fa6-7d50-9fc8-8b61-38f73553ecd5","model":"glm-5.2","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"prompt_tokens":23382,"completion_tokens":454,"reasoning_tokens":0,"total_tokens":23836,"cached_tokens":3456,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":3456},"prompt_cost":0.000000,"completion_cost":0.000000,"cache_cost":0.000000}}